<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-ATKINSON ON TRIAL AT METZ.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ATKINSON ON TRIAL AT METZ.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>English striker Dalian Atkinson, who plays for Turkish club Fenerbahce, is having a trial with French first division Metz, Metz club sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Atkinson joined Fenerbahce last year from English premier league Aston Villa for whom he scored 35 goals in three seasons.</p>
<p>He will stay in Metz until Sunday. A decision on a possible transfer will be taken next week.</p>
</text>
